 each workbench's last\n  activity, owner, and reserved resources, with last activity sourced from the\n  notebook controller's activity tracking.\n- Given a project with completed pipeline runs, the console shows a stale\n  pipeline-run report listing completed runs older than the configured age with\n  their retained artifacts, sourced from Kubeflow Pipelines run metadata.\n- The stale-run age threshold is configurable.\n- Given either report, an administrator can export it as CSV.\n- The notebook controller and Kubeflow Pipelines operate without code changes\n  for this reporting (passive validation): the reports read their data through\n  Kubernetes-API-accessible surfaces, and existing console views of workbenches\n  and pipeline runs continue to work.\n- No automated reclamation/deletion or cost/chargeback functionality is\n  introduced.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P1): per-project idle-workbench report (last activity, owner, reserved\n  resources) sourced from notebook controller activity tracking.\n- HLR-2 (P1): stale pipeline-run report (completed runs older than a\n  configurable age with retained artifacts) sourced from Kubeflow Pipelines run\n  metadata.\n- HLR-3 (P2, bundled): CSV export of either report — bundled because it renders\n  the same report data through the same report views; not separately\n  schedulable.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":31673,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ade09980934e35a3","agent_id":"a295249375e97db80","session_id":"a5b399fb-2abb-4e32-b670-8f935a1667d4","uuid":"6c45385e-27e2-4fd3-975f-6243aae7743b","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:48:25.816Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9016"}
